# Git attributes for the dotfiles repo.
#
# starship.toml mixes hand-written prompt styles with a Noctalia-generated
# palette block. Starship has no native `include`, so Noctalia injects the
# palette in-file between `>>> NOCTALIA STARSHIP PALETTE >>>` markers. The
# noctalia-starship clean filter strips that block (plus the leading
# `palette = "noctalia"` line) on commit, so wallpaper refreshes don't
# produce noise diffs. Smudge is a no-op: the working copy stays whole.
/starship.toml filter=noctalia-starship
